## 🏛️ 2. Detailed Architectural Rationale & Canvas Alignment

### 🚨 1. Business Need
* **Strategic Rationale:**  
  Formulates the qualitative cornerstone of the entire document chain by diagnosing the primary systemic friction: structural time gridlock, vehicle depreciation waste, driver duty-hour depletion, and unquantified auxiliary diesel exhaust burning at key corridor chokepoints.
* **Alignment to DSC:**  
  Establishes the real-world operational imbalance that directly triggers our Unique Value Proposition (UVP). It frames time loss and stationary fuel waste not as unavoidable facts of cross-border transport, but as an unmonetized efficiency asset class that can be actively recovered through software.

