### 🛠️ 4. Technical Domain Division (The 3Tutors Stack)

#### 🔵 Logistics Middleware Layer (Shlok's Domain)
* **Strategic Rationale:**  
  Governs the ingestion and normalization of unstructured real-time edge telemetry data across the border checkpoint perimeter.
* **Alignment to DSC:**  
  Executes the data-acquisition loops detailed in Key Technology & Resources (KTR) and Key Activities (KA). Shlok’s REST API middleware orchestrates fragmented, siloed peripheral infrastructure data strings—specifically optical character recognition license strings (`ocr_feed`), driver identification tokens (`rfid_scan`), and dynamic weigh-in-motion scales (`wim_scales`)—unifying them into a single payload without requiring capital-intensive hardware overhauls.

#### 🔴 Cryptographic Backend Engine (Sergii's Domain)
* **Strategic Rationale:**  
  Operates as the central logic gate for database integrity, execution speed, and tokenization security.
* **Alignment to DSC:**  
  Drives the technical execution of the Engineering & Isolation Governance (GO) and Key Stakeholders (KS) blocks. Sergii’s cryptographic backend ingests Shlok’s normalized middleware feeds to instantly generate a secure, anonymized pre-authentication hash (`manifest_id_hash`) within a sub-second threshold. Simultaneously, his architecture evaluates system physics calculations to certify strict additionality data required by third-party registries to mint compliance-grade environmental assets.

#### 🟢 Frontend GIS UI Display (Nelia's Domain)
* **Strategic Rationale:**  
  Manages the user viewport, administrative data visibility, and institutional stakeholder trust.
* **Alignment to DSC:**  
  Translates complex system metrics into the clear interface required by the Customer Relationships (CR) block. Nelia constructs the multi-tenant WebGL 2D/3D digital twin visualization dashboard. By mapping the interface as a completely passive, read-only overlay (`governance_loop_active = TRUE`), she provides public sector clients and international development banks with transparent anti-corruption audit trails without requiring invasive write-access to active customs security servers.

